    <h1>19 Days Xinjiang China &amp; Uzbekistan Tour</h1>
    <div class="route">📍 Kashgar → Taxkorgan → Kuqa → Urumqi → Turpan → Dunhuang → Tashkent → Bukhara → Samarkand</div>
